<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cognizant started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cognizant started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter said it started coverage of Cognizant Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 35-1/4 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
